### Which demographic factors are associated with change of voting intentions? 

To determine which demographic variables are associated with change of voting intentions, we ran statistical models. These models are explained in the Appendix (@sec-appendix-voting). Here, we only report the variables that were statistically significant in these models. 


::: {.cell}

:::


#### Sex

