## Individual action for society {#sec-individual-action}

In this section, we look at how volunteers have changed regarding their perception on whether their individual action can contribute to changing society. This was measured with the question: "En général, pensez-vous que votre action individuelle peut contribuer à changer la société ?", which has been asked at time points q1 and q3. We look at the different cohorts separately (promo 2020-21, @fig-action_individuelle_societe-2020; promo 2021-22, @fig-vote_derniers_elections-2021; 2022-23, @fig-vote_derniers_elections-2022; 2023-24, @fig-vote_derniers_elections-2023).

Descriptively, there is no clear positive or negative trend. On average, across all cohorts, slightly more people are changing towards "No" or "Not really", compared to "Yes".

